    <string name="field_autonomy_name">Autonomy</string>
    <string name="field_autonomy_description">The two reserves that run out, on one page: water above, sugar below. Which resupply point is the last one before there is nothing, and what the rest of the route still costs in kilojoules, split by climb. You only stop once, and seeing both together is what tells you whether to stop at this point or hold out for the next. Needs a full page; its lower half also needs a power meter.</string>
